  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Mass of gas $=4 \\mathrm{g} \\quad$ (given)\r\nFrom pertect gas equation\r\n$$\r\np V=n R T\r\n$$\r\nwhere $n=$ number of moles here, $\\left(n=\\frac{4}{2}=2\\right)$\r\n$\\therefore \\quad p V=2 R T$\r\nIt will be the perfect gas equation for $4 \\mathrm{g}$ of hydrogen.",
